{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "dc17f42d-021a-4dd7-a1bf-bb6751818eb0",
    "name": "OMNI [1007] - Notificaciones y Alertas Centralizadas",
    "description": "Coleccion de pruebas del modulo 1007. Correr la carpeta '0. Autenticacion' primero (Login Paso 2 deja el token en la variable de entorno). Ver docs/MANUAL_PRUEBAS.md para la guia completa paso a paso.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Autenticacion",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login Paso 1 - obtener sedes disponibles",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"interlocutor_id\": 0\n}"
            },
            "description": "Paso 1 del login de dos pasos. Devuelve available_interlocutors -- las sedes a las que tiene acceso el usuario. No usa este token para nada mas."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Devuelve available_interlocutors', () => {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('available_interlocutors');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Paso 2 - reautenticar con sede (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"interlocutor_id\": \"{{interlocutor_id}}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Paso 2: login final con la sede elegida. El token resultante SI sirve para las siguientes peticiones. Requiere que el usuario tenga los permisos notifications.read y notifications.admin para poder correr toda la collection."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Devuelve token', () => pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('token'));",
                  "if (json.data && json.data.token) { pm.environment.set('token', json.data.token); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (usuario SIN notifications.admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username_no_admin}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password_no_admin}}\",\n  \"interlocutor_id\": \"{{interlocutor_id}}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Usuario de prueba que SOLO tiene notifications.read (ej. Encargado de Tienda), usado en la carpeta de Casos Negativos / RBAC para confirmar que el backend bloquea correctamente los endpoints de administrador."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.data && json.data.token) { pm.environment.set('token_no_admin', json.data.token); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Refrescar token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/refresh",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "refresh"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Usar si el token expira a mitad de la sesión de pruebas (HTTP 401)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /auth/me - confirmar usuario autenticado",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/me",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Util para confirmar que el token activo corresponde al usuario y rol esperado antes de correr el resto de la collection."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Ejecutar en orden antes de correr cualquier otra carpeta. Login Paso 2 deja el token guardado automaticamente en la variable de entorno {{token}}."
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Notificaciones (usuario)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /notifications - Listar mis notificaciones",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Interlocutor-Id",
                "value": "{{interlocutor_id}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Subsystem-Id",
                "value": "{{subsystem_id}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/notifications?unread_only=false&limit=20&offset=0",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "notifications"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "unread_only",
                  "value": "false"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "20"
                },
                {
                  "key": "offset",
                  "value": "0"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Requiere permiso notifications.read. El resultado esta filtrado automaticamente por interlocutor/rol/nivel jerarquico del usuario autenticado -- no se puede pedir el de otra sede via parametros."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('status success', () => pm.expect(json.status).to.eql('success'));",
                  "pm.test('trae total_unread y notifications[]', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('total_unread');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.notifications).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});",
                  "if (json.data.notifications.length > 0) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('notification_id', json.data.notifications[0].id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "PATCH /notifications/{id}/read - Marcar como leida",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
